{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19684","headline":"岳阳怀古 · 吕温","name":"岳阳怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨飙发荆州，落日到巴丘。\n方知刳剡利，可接鬼神游。\n二湖豁南寖，九派驶东流。\n襟带三千里，尽在岳阳楼。\n忆昔鬬羣雄，此焉争上游。\n吴昌屯虎旅，晋盛骛龙舟。\n宋齐纷祸难，梁陈成寇雠。\n钟鼓长震耀，鱼龙不得休。\n风雪一萧散，功业忽如浮。\n今日时无事，空江满白鸥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}